    "ciphertext": "~022079476854617318923",
    "title": "Ai image specialist",
    "description": "Starstruck is a fast-growing luxury fashion <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> creating premium tracksuits, shorts sets, outerwear, suits, and lifestyle apparel. We’re looking for a highly skilled AI <span class=\"highlight\">designer</span> who can help us produce world-class product imagery that rivals <span class=\"highlight\">brands</span> like Kith, Fear of God, Dior, and Louis Vuitton.\n\nThis is long-term work. We release new products regularly and need someone who can become part of our creative team.\n\n⸻\n\nWhat You’ll Do\n\nFor every product, create a complete image package including:\n\nStudio Product Images\n\n* Front view\n* 45° front angle\n* Side view\n* Back view\n\nDetail Images\n\n* Logo close-up\n* Fabric texture close-up\n* Zipper & hardware close-up\n* Pocket/detail close-up\n\nLifestyle Images\n\n* Standing pose\n* Walking pose\n* Sitting pose\n* Luxury campaign image\n\nDeliverables\n\n* Shopify-ready images\n* High-resolution files\n* White background product shots\n* Luxury lifestyle images\n* Consistent collage layout similar to premium fashion <span class=\"highlight\">brands</span>\n\n⸻\n\nRequirements\n\nYou must have experience with:\n\n* ChatGPT Image Generation\n* Adobe Photoshop\n* Midjourney (preferred)\n* Flux (preferred)\n* ComfyUI (preferred)\n* AI image editing\n* Luxury fashion retouching\n* Product image compositing\n\nYou should understand:\n\n* High-end fashion photography\n* Luxury lighting\n* Fabric realism\n* Consistent <span class=\"highlight\">branding</span>\n* Premium e-commerce <span class=\"highlight\">design</span>\n\n⸻\n\nWhat Success Looks Like\n\nEvery product should have:\n\n* Identical lighting\n* Identical camera angles\n* Identical model proportions\n* Consistent backgrounds\n* Premium luxury aesthetic\n* Website-ready quality\n\nThe goal is for our website to look as polished as <span class=\"highlight\">brands</span> like Kith, Aimé Leon Dore, and Fear of God.",
