  "siblingJobs": [
    {
      "title": "Ads manager",
      "ciphertext": "~022078944364647858820",
      "description": "We’re looking for an experienced Meta Ads Manager to help scale our luxury fashion brand, Starstruck Collection, on Shopify. Our goal is to build a premium apparel brand with consistent, profitable growth through Facebook and Instagram advertising. We need someone who is data-driven, proactive, and experienced with scaling Shopify e-commerce brands. Responsibilities: * Create, launch, and manage Meta (Facebook & Instagram) ad campaigns * Build prospecting, retargeting, and lookalike audience campaigns * Analyze performance and optimize for ROAS, CPA, CTR, and conversion rate * Test new creatives, audiences, and offers weekly * Scale winning campaigns while maintaining profitability * Set up and optimize Meta Pixel and Conversion API * Coordinate with our Shopify and Klaviyo team to maximize customer lifetime value * Provide weekly reports and recommendations Requirements: * Proven success managing Meta Ads for Shopify e-commerce brands * Experience scaling fashion or apparel brands is highly preferred * Strong understanding of Meta Ads Manager * Experience with Pixel, Conversion API, and attribution * Ability to interpret data and make strategic recommendations * Excellent communication and availability for weekly strategy calls What I’d like to see when applying: * Examples of Shopify brands you’ve scaled * ROAS, CPA, and revenue results you’ve achieved * Monthly ad budgets you’ve managed * Your approach to scaling a new luxury fashion brand About Us Starstruck Collection is a fast-growing luxury streetwear and lifestyle brand based in the United States. We’re building a long-term team of specialists and are looking for someone who wants to grow with the brand. Please answer these questions when applying: 1. Have you managed Meta Ads for a Shopify fashion or apparel brand? 2. What was the highest monthly revenue you’ve helped generate? 3. What average ROAS do you typically target? 4. If you joined today, what would your first 30-day plan be for Starstruck Collection? 5. Can you share screenshots or case studies of your results?"
    },
    {
      "title": "Personal assistant for clothing brand",
      "ciphertext": "~022076873001925938511",
      "description": "Executive Ecommerce Virtual Assistant (Shopify) – Long-Term We are a fast-growing luxury fashion brand looking for a reliable, detail-oriented Executive Ecommerce Virtual Assistant to become a long-term member of our team. This is not just a customer service position. We need someone who can help manage daily business operations and keep our brand running efficiently. Responsibilities * Manage our Shopify store * Upload new products, collections, and variants * Update inventory and product descriptions * Respond to customer emails and inquiries * Process orders, returns, and exchanges * Coordinate with manufacturers and suppliers * Communicate with freelancers and team members * Organize projects and help keep the business on schedule * Perform internet research and administrative tasks * Assist with email marketing (Klaviyo experience is a plus) * Support social media and marketing projects when needed Requirements * Proven Shopify experience * Excellent written and spoken English * Strong organizational and communication skills * Ability to work independently and solve problems * Experience with Google Workspace * Experience with Klaviyo, GoHighLevel, Canva, or Meta Ads is a plus * Reliable internet connection * Available 30–40 hours per week What We’re Looking For We’re looking for someone who takes ownership, communicates proactively, and wants to grow with our company for the long term. We value honesty, attention to detail, and someone who can help us build a world-class fashion brand."
    }
  ]
